@baseUrl = http://localhost:6626
@token =  
@contentType = application/json

### 1. 人员业绩分页查询（基础查询）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/governance/performance/employee/page
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
token: {{token}}

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

